Subject: [PATCH 1299/3799] soh: rename func_808B1BEC ->
 BgSpot09Obj_InitCollision

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: one of the three setup steps: registers the variant's collision header as a bg actor when it has one.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot09_Obj/z_bg_spot09_obj.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot09_Obj/z_bg_spot09_obj.c    | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot09_Obj/z_bg_spot09_obj.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot09_Obj/z_bg_spot09_obj.c
